      "value": "@{58c6d558ff44e44ada717902|full_name}: That looks like a good start. Would it be possible to allow general info posts there in addition to questions? Forums are a great way of doing self-documenting community knowledge, but they need to have a proper balance between purely informational content and questions. Otherwise everyone will just stick to using the Discord channel where things will be more up-to-date and answers will come quicker.\n\nSide note: I didn't actually know that page existed until now - so it could probably stand to be advertised a bit more around the community.",
